  {
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "also could you check if your cudnn is built with CUDA 13.0. In general, I see cudart version != nvrtc version being the most common issue for cases which work on 12 TK but not on 13 TK, meaning that even CUDA runtime version is 13 but cuDNN is built with older version.",
