  {
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "> I don't have immediate access to RTX 5090 rn, could you run again with env ` CUDNN_FRONTEND_LOG_FILE=fe.log CUDNN_FRONTEND_LOG_INFO=1 CUDNN_LOGLEVEL_DBG=3 CUDNN_LOGDEST_DBG=be.log` and attach the logs here?\n\nThis is also reproducible in H100 and B200.  I've attached the log files here.\n\n[be.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22891594/be.log)\n[fe.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22891593/fe.log)\n\n> also could you check if your cudnn is built with CUDA 13.0. In general, I see cudart version != nvrtc version being the most common issue for cases which work on 12 TK but not on 13 TK, meaning that even CUDA runtime version is 13 but cuDNN is built with older version.\n\nI did not install cudnn or CUDA manually. I'm using the builtin CUDA and cudnn from jax installed with pip (`jax[cuda13]`).\n",
